Third-party content
-------------------
None. This repository vendors no third-party source, artwork, data, fonts,
media, generated assets or copies of XNote/Xpad. Runtime imports are supplied
by GNOME Shell and the host system.

Runtime relationship
--------------------
The extension recognizes windows created by the separately installed XNote
application and reads XNote's user-owned local note files only to match a pad
identity. XNote is a GPL-3.0-or-later fork of Xpad maintained and distributed
separately; neither application source nor user note content is part of this
distribution.
